       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HELLOCALC.
       AUTHOR. LEGACYSHIFT-EXAMPLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  A PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       01  B PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       01  RESULT PIC 999 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 10 TO A
           MOVE 20 TO B
           PERFORM ADD-PARA
           DISPLAY "Result: " RESULT
           STOP RUN.
       ADD-PARA.
           COMPUTE RESULT = A + B.
